@startuml
title 1. Sign-up
autonumber
actor User
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Auth
database AuthDB

User -> Client : Enter email + password
Client -> Gateway : POST /auth/register
Gateway -> Auth : route (no token required)
Auth -> AuthDB : check email uniqueness
alt email already exists
    Auth --> Gateway : 409 Conflict
    Gateway --> Client : 409
else new user
    Auth -> Auth : hash password (bcrypt/argon2)
    Auth -> AuthDB : insert user + default settings\n(mode=BOTH, all categories)
    Auth --> Gateway : 201 Created
    Gateway --> Client : 201
end
@enduml
